# Gol POS environment (copy to .env; never commit the real file)
# The Gol brain's primary provider is the Meta Model API (Muse). Its key
# stays server-side only and reaches the brain in one of two ways:
#   1. META_MODEL_API_KEY set directly in the server environment, or
#   2. META_API_KEY_FILE pointing at a server-side file that holds either a
#      bare key or a META_MODEL_API_KEY=... line (e.g. an env file kept
#      outside the web root).
META_API_KEY_FILE=/path/to/meta-api-key.txt
# Model for the Gol brain
META_MODEL=muse-spark-1.3
# Deep-think lane (owner analysis questions); defaults to muse-wonder-1.0
# META_MODEL_WONDER=muse-wonder-1.0
# The photo lane (sam-3.1) and poster lane (muse-image-1.0) use the same key.
